sequenceDiagram
  actor OCC as OCC controller
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as api
  participant NET as network
  participant REC as recovery + crew
  participant PAX as passengers
  participant EXP as explain (Claude / template)
  OCC->>UI: pick flight (search, suggestion or watchlist), set delay
  UI->>API: POST /scenarios (flight, DELAY, minutes)
  API->>NET: propagate along the rotation, 7 days
  NET-->>API: affected flights + new times
  API->>PAX: re-check connections vs MCT
  PAX-->>API: misconnects, slack, miss risk, rebooking
  API->>REC: absorb · swaps · hold · cancel / consolidate
  REC-->>API: KPIs, cost, crew FDP status per option
  API->>API: rank under 3 strategies, pick recommendation
  API->>EXP: engine facts only (no names, PNRs)
  EXP-->>API: explanation
  API-->>UI: options, strategies, crew alerts, rotation board, passengers
  OCC->>UI: switch strategy / select option (what-if)
  OCC->>UI: approve, or override with a reason (audited)
